OL,3,GNEWSAShe started by peeling potatoes,
OL,4,Anow she is one of Britain's best-known
OL,5,Aonline chefs
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore she became known to millions
OL,8,Fonline as the "Potato Queen", Poppy
OL,9,FO'Toole was peeling potatoes in a
OL,10,Fvillage pub kitchen.
OL,12,FNow a chef, author and TV regular,
OL,13,FO'Toole has built a huge following
OL,14,Fthrough social media, published six
OL,15,Fcookbooks and become one of Britain's
OL,16,Fbest-known food personalities.
OL,18,FKnown to viewers from programmes
OL,19,Fincluding Saturday Kitchen and This
OL,20,FMorning, the Bromsgrove-born chef's
OL,21,Fjourney began much closer to home.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
