OL,3,GNEWSAShe started by peeling potatoes,
OL,4,Anow she is one of Britain's best-known
OL,5,Aonline chefs
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe remembers cooking calamari after
OL,8,Fschool at the age of 11, leaving her
OL,9,Fmother wondering why her daughter had
OL,10,Fdecided to deep-fry squid instead of
OL,11,Freaching for more conventional
OL,12,Fafter-school snacks.
